> expand (x+1)^3
  ucas: expand (x+1)^3
expand (x + 1)^3
  = x^3 + 3x^2 + 3x + 1
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (2*x - 3)*(x + 4)
  ucas: expand (2*x - 3)*(x + 4)
expand (2x - 3)*(x + 4)
  = 2x^2 + 5x - 12
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (x - 4)*(3*x - 1)
  ucas: expand (x - 4)*(3*x - 1)
expand (x - 4)*(3x - 1)
  = 3x^2 - 13x + 4
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (x^2 + 2x + 1)*(x^2 - 2x + 1)
  ucas: expand (x^2 + 2x + 1)*(x^2 - 2x + 1)
expand (x^2 + 2x + 1)*(x^2 - 2x + 1)
  = x^4 - 2x^2 + 1
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (5x + 5)*(x^2 - 2x + 6)
  ucas: expand (5x + 5)*(x^2 - 2x + 6)
expand (5x + 5)*(x^2 - 2x + 6)
  = 5x^3 - 5x^2 + 20x + 30
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (x+1)*(x+2)*(x+3)*(x+4)
  ucas: expand (x+1)*(x+2)*(x+3)*(x+4)
expand (x + 1)*(x + 2)*(x + 3)*(x + 4)
  = x^4 + 10x^3 + 35x^2 + 50x + 24
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
